cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "ERC France Attribution: Lab, University and Region Attribution of French ERC Grants"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "SIRIS Academic"
abstract: >
  A reproducible pipeline and dataset attributing every French-hosted ERC grant (2016-2026
  start-date cohort) to the performing laboratory at grant start, then to its tutelle
  universities, city and region — defeating the RTO-headquarters effect by which CORDIS books
  most French ERC grants to national research organisations (CNRS, INSERM, CEA, Inria, INRAE)
  rather than to the university-affiliated lab that actually performed the work.
license: MIT
version: "1.5.0"
date-released: "2026-08-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dorothee-siris/erc-france-attribution"
keywords:
  - ERC
  - European Research Council
  - France
  - research funding attribution
  - RNSR
  - bibliometrics
  - regional portfolio mapping
